{"id":8,"ts":1790739147.229047,"type":"tool_result","parent":7,"payload":{"name":"search_kb","result":"[{\"title\": \"Refund approval limits\", \"text\": \"Agents may refund orders up to $200 directly. Anything above $200 must be escalated to a manager, who reviews it within one business day. For damaged furniture, issue the full refund right away; escalation is not required.\"}, {\"title\": \"Return shipping labels\", \"text\": \"Prepaid return labels are emailed within one business day. Large furniture is collected by our freight partner; the customer schedules a pickup window.\"}, {\"title\": \"Refund timing\", \"text\": \"Refunds are returned to the original payment method. Card refunds take 5 to 10 business days to appear. Store credit is available immediately.\"}, {\"title\": \"Damaged deliveries\", \"text\": \"If an item arrives damaged, ask the customer for a photo of the damage. Damaged items do not need to be shipped back when the damage is visible in the photo. Offer a replacement first if the item is in stock.\"}]"},"meta":{}}
